## Why This Is Asked
This question validates the ability to design an automated security response system for multi-tenant Azure SaaS environments, integrating threat detection with immediate containment and recovery capabilities.

## Key Concepts
- Anomaly detection using Defender for Cloud analytics and Sentinel ML models
- Event Grid-based alert routing and per-tenant processing
- Automated resource isolation via NSG rules, private endpoint restrictions, and conditional access policies
- Key Vault credential rotation and token revocation workflows
- Deployment slot rollback with feature flag coordination
- Comprehensive audit trails across all security actions

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-logic for automated breach response
async function handleSecurityAlert(alert) {
  if (alert.severity > 3) {
    await isolateTenantResources(alert.tenantId);
    await rotateCompromisedCredentials(alert.tenantId);
    await initiateSafeRollback(alert.tenantId);
  }
}
```

## Why This Is Asked
Tests understanding of basic network security controls in Azure and practical rollout/rollback.

## Key Concepts
- Private Link and Private Endpoints
- Storage Account network rules (default deny)
- Azure Policy enforcement
- Rollback and test strategies

## Code Example
```bicep
param storageAccountName string
param vnetSubnetId string
resource pe 'Microsoft.Network/privateEndpoints@2020-11-01' = {
  name: '${storageAccountName}-pe'
  location: resourceGroup().location
  properties: {
    subnet: { id: vnetSubnetId }
    privateLinkServiceConnections: [
      {
        name: 'storageBlob'
        properties: {
          privateLinkServiceId: '/subscriptions/.../resourceGroups/.../providers/Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts/${storageAccountName}'
          groupIds: [ 'blob' ]
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "policyRule": {
    "if": {
      "allOf": [
        { "field": "type", "equals": "Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts" },
        { "not": { "field": "Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts/privateEndpointConnections", "exists": true } }
        }
      ]
    },
    "then": { "effect": "deny" }
  }
}
```

